Hi,

I got the same error on this test dataset.
The protein you sent me is actually a protein group. The useNumProteinsColumn parameter controls what PD converter does with protein groups. Please try setting this parameter to FALSE or using different column as protein ID. Can't tell if this will fix the problem for full dataset. Please let me know if the error persists.

Kind regards
Mateusz

